bjects/shirt_soft.svg` | **YES** | **200 OK** | Real Artwork Object (Hàng may mặc mềm) | ✅ **P\n<truncated 1268 bytes>","Description":"\"Cập nhật ACTIVITY_01_ASSET_MANIFEST.md chuẩn xác\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\ACTIVITY_01_ASSET_MANIFEST.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update ACTIVITY_01_ASSET_MANIFEST.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
